Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 16:56:41 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 06/13] feat(ui): RealSense output and depth range, depth
 previews, color-only camera lists

- Camera form: a RealSense camera picks its output (color, depth, or color +
  depth aligned to color) and, with depth, the depth range; resolutions and
  frame rates follow the output and the camera's USB connection, and an
  unavailable mode is pointed out.
- Episode viewer: depth videos play as their colorized preview.
- Dataset cameras (thumbnails, training camera mapping) leave depth maps out.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
